Cell["\<\
192*Alfa2*chiz*gLnu*conj(chiz)*conj(gLnu)*pow(Pi,2)*
   (conj(gLf)*(gRf*mfsq*s12 + gLf*pow(s12 - s13,2)) + conj(gRf)*(gLf*mfsq*s12 \
