   (((-Log(-1 + (-2 + y)/Sqrt((-4 + y)*y)) + Log(1 + (-2 + y)/Sqrt((-4 + \
y)*y)))*(4 + pow(y,2)))/
      2. + 2*pow((-4 + y)*y,1/2.) - pow((-4 + y)*pow(y,3),1/2.))\
\>", "Output",
